20 0 obj
<<
/Title (Awareness and Prevention Tips 1. Verify the sender's email address. 2. Do not click suspicious links. 3. Never share passwords or OTPs through email. 4. Check for spelling and grammar mistakes. 5. Enable Multi-Factor Authentication \(MFA\). 6. Report suspicious emails to the organization. Conclusion This project analyzed different email types and identified indicators that help distinguish between safe, suspicious, and phishing emails. Understanding these indicators can help users avoid phishing attacks and improve overall cybersecurity awareness.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 86 0 R
>>
